  <div class="container om-narrow text-center">
    <h2 id="omCtaTitle">There’s a Place for You in This Community</h2>
    <p>Whether you’re caring for someone you love, looking for ways to support caregivers, or interested in partnering with Legacy, we’d love to connect.</p>
    <p>Caregivers shouldn’t have to do everything alone. And organizations shouldn’t have to work alone to support them.</p>
